# Position paper reader — kept off the public site.
# This repository is PUBLIC and GitHub Pages deploys from a fresh checkout,
# so anything ignored here can reach neither the repo nor the built site.
#
#   1. Generated route stubs (`npm run paper:on` / `paper:off`). Without them
#      SvelteKit has no /position-paper/read route to build at all.
#   2. The real, unpublished draft. Only position-paper.example.md is committed.
src/routes/position-paper/read/
src/lib/content/position-paper.md
